---
source: crates/m2-server-core/tests/whispers.rs
expression: h.log
---
-- Alice whispers to Bob, in another empire, by name in any case:
-- Bob gets it from Alice, Alice gets it back as hers to Bob; Carol nothing
@1000 conn#2 sends SendWhisper to=bOB "hello Bob"
   -> send conn#4 Whisper from Alice "hello Bob"
   -> send conn#2 Whisper to Bob "hello Bob"
-- Bob answers
@1000 conn#4 sends SendWhisper to=alice "hi Alice"
   -> send conn#2 Whisper from Bob "hi Alice"
   -> send conn#4 Whisper to Alice "hi Alice"
-- a name nobody in the game has (Carol left) and one no character has:
-- the same answer, nobody of that name in the game
@1000 conn#6 closed: the client left
   -> store #13: save #3 at (963400, 278200) played 0s
   -> send conn#2 EntityRemove vid=3
   -> event: conn#6: closed: the client left
@1000 store answers #13: saved: Ok(())
@1000 conn#2 sends SendWhisper to=Carol "are you there"
   -> send conn#2 WhisperRefused Carol reason=1
@1000 conn#2 sends SendWhisper to=Nobody "anyone"
   -> send conn#2 WhisperRefused Nobody reason=1
-- empty lines and lines with control characters are dropped;
-- our own name and a name that is no character's are ignored
@1000 conn#2 sends SendWhisper to=Bob ""
@1000 conn#2 sends SendWhisper to=Bob "two\nlines"
@1000 conn#2 sends SendWhisper to=ALICE "me"
   -> event: conn#2: ignored SendWhisper
@1000 conn#2 sends SendWhisper to=B o b "spaces"
   -> event: conn#2: ignored SendWhisper
@1000 conn#2 sends SendWhisper to=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa "too long a name"
   -> event: conn#2: ignored SendWhisper
